{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2019,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Dada la función \\(f:(0,2\\pi)\\to\\mathbb R\\), definida por \\(f(x)=\\mathrm{sen}(x)+\\cos(x)\\), calcula sus máximos y mínimos relativos y los puntos de inflexión de la gráfica de \\(f\\) (abscisas en los que se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan).","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>El dominio es \\((0,2\\pi)\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Rayamos la parte de la recta que queda fuera del dominio: ahí la función no está definida y no se estudia.</i> y \\(f\\) es derivable; no hay puntos «problemáticos».</p><p><b>Extremos relativos.</b> Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x\\]\\[\\cos x-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x=0\\iff\\mathrm{tg}\\,x=1\\Rightarrow\\boxed{x=\\frac\\pi4},\\ \\boxed{x=\\frac{5\\pi}4}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 302 108' width='100%' style='max-width:362px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H288' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M264 56L268 48M268 56L272 48M272 56L276 48M276 56L280 48M280 56L284 48M284 56L288 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>π/4</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>5π/4</text><path d='M262 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='262' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2π</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M65.0 40L101.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M92.0 11L101.0 10L99.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0,5) &gt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M139.0 10L175.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M166.0 39L175.0 40L173.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(π) &lt; 0</text><text x='199.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M213.0 40L249.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M240.0 11L249.0 10L247.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='225.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(6) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) crece en \\(\\left(0,\\frac\\pi4\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}4,2\\pi\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\(\\left(\\frac\\pi4,\\frac{5\\pi}4\\right)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Alcanza un máximo en \\(x=\\frac\\pi4\\) de valor \\(f\\left(\\frac\\pi4\\right)=\\sqrt2\\) y un mínimo en \\(x=\\frac{5\\pi}4\\) de valor \\(f\\left(\\frac{5\\pi}4\\right)=-\\sqrt2\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>.</p><p><b>Puntos de inflexión.</b> Estudiamos su curvatura:</p>\\[f''(x)=-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-\\cos x\\]\\[-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-\\cos x=0\\iff\\mathrm{tg}\\,x=-1\\Rightarrow\\boxed{x=\\frac{3\\pi}4},\\ \\boxed{x=\\frac{7\\pi}4}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 302 108' width='100%' style='max-width:362px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H288' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M14 56L18 48M18 56L22 48M22 56L26 48M26 56L30 48M30 56L34 48M34 56L38 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M264 56L268 48M268 56L272 48M272 56L276 48M276 56L280 48M280 56L284 48M284 56L288 48' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.1'/><path d='M40 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='40' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M114 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='114' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3π/4</text><path d='M188 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='188' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>7π/4</text><path d='M262 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='262' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2π</text><text x='51.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M73.0 40Q89.0 4 105.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='77.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(π/2) &lt; 0</text><text x='125.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M147.0 12Q163.0 48 179.0 12' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='151.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(π) &gt; 0</text><text x='199.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M221.0 40Q237.0 4 253.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2.2' fill='none'/><text x='225.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>″(6) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) es cóncava en \\(\\left(0,\\frac{3\\pi}4\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}4,2\\pi\\right)\\), porque \\(f''\\lt0\\), y convexa en \\(\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}4,\\frac{7\\pi}4\\right)\\), porque \\(f''\\gt0\\). Tiene puntos de inflexión en \\(x=\\frac{3\\pi}4\\) y \\(x=\\frac{7\\pi}4\\), los dos de valor \\(0\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='28.0,45.8 30.4,43.2 32.8,40.7 35.2,38.5 37.6,36.5 40.0,34.6 42.4,33.0 44.8,31.6 47.2,30.4 49.6,29.5 52.0,28.8 54.4,28.4 56.8,28.1 59.2,28.2 61.6,28.4 64.0,29.0 66.3,29.7 68.7,30.7 71.1,31.9 73.5,33.4 75.9,35.0 78.3,36.9 80.7,39.0 83.1,41.3 85.5,43.8 87.9,46.5 90.3,49.3 92.7,52.3 95.1,55.4 97.5,58.7 99.9,62.1 102.3,65.6 104.7,69.3 107.1,72.9 109.5,76.7 111.8,80.5 114.2,84.3 116.6,88.2 119.0,92.1 121.4,96.0 123.8,99.8 126.2,103.6 128.6,107.4 131.0,111.0 133.4,114.6 135.8,118.1 138.2,121.5 140.6,124.8 143.0,127.9 145.4,130.9 147.8,133.8 150.2,136.4 152.6,138.9 155.0,141.2 157.3,143.2 159.7,145.1 162.1,146.8 164.5,148.2 166.9,149.4 169.3,150.4 171.7,151.1 174.1,151.6 176.5,151.8 178.9,151.8 181.3,151.6 183.7,151.1 186.1,150.4 188.5,149.5 190.9,148.3 193.3,146.9 195.7,145.2 198.1,143.4 200.5,141.3 202.8,139.1 205.2,136.6 207.6,134.0 210.0,131.2 212.4,128.2 214.8,125.1 217.2,121.8 219.6,118.4 222.0,114.9 224.4,111.3 226.8,107.7 229.2,103.9 231.6,100.1 234.0,96.3 236.4,92.4 238.8,88.5 241.2,84.7 243.6,80.8 246.0,77.0 248.3,73.2 250.7,69.5 253.1,65.9 255.5,62.4 257.9,59.0 260.3,55.7 262.7,52.5 265.1,49.5 267.5,46.7' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='57.7' cy='28.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='61.7' y='22.1'>máx</text><circle cx='177.8' cy='151.9' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='181.8' y='165.9'>mín</text><circle cx='117.7' cy='90.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='121.7' y='82.0'>PI</text><circle cx='237.9' cy='90.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='241.9' y='82.0'>PI</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 90.0H294.0M27.6 174.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='65.9' y1='87.0' x2='65.9' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='62.9' y='104.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='104.1' y1='87.0' x2='104.1' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='101.1' y='104.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='142.4' y1='87.0' x2='142.4' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='139.4' y='104.0' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='180.6' y1='87.0' x2='180.6' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='177.6' y='104.0' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='218.8' y1='87.0' x2='218.8' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='215.8' y='104.0' font-size='10'>5</text><line x1='257.1' y1='87.0' x2='257.1' y2='93.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='254.1' y='104.0' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='24.6' y1='133.8' x2='30.6' y2='133.8' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='11.6' y='137.8' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='24.6' y1='46.2' x2='30.6' y2='46.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='11.6' y='50.2' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Máximo relativo en \\(\\left(\\dfrac\\pi4,\\sqrt2\\right)\\); mínimo relativo en \\(\\left(\\dfrac{5\\pi}4,-\\sqrt2\\right)\\); puntos de inflexión en \\(\\left(\\dfrac{3\\pi}4,0\\right)\\) y \\(\\left(\\dfrac{7\\pi}4,0\\right)\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":""},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"curv","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2019-RESERVA_4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2019-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función dada por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}-x^2+6x-8&\\text{si }x\\le4\\\\x^2-6x+8&\\text{si }x\\gt4\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Calcula los puntos de corte entre la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta \\(y=2x-4\\). Esboza el recinto que delimitan la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta.","(1 p.) Calcula el área del recinto anterior."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f\\) es continua en \\(x=4\\) (los dos tramos valen \\(0\\)). Igualo cada tramo con la recta:</p><p>• Si \\(x\\le4\\): \\(-x^2+6x-8=2x-4\\iff x^2-4x+4=0\\iff(x-2)^2=0\\iff x=2\\) (raíz doble: la recta es tangente en \\((2,0)\\)).</p><p>• Si \\(x\\gt4\\): \\(x^2-6x+8=2x-4\\iff x^2-8x+12=0\\iff x=2\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=6\\). Solo vale \\(x=6\\gt4\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='78.2,184.1 82.1,180.6 86.0,177.2 89.9,173.7 93.7,170.3 97.6,166.8 101.5,163.4 105.4,159.9 109.3,156.5 113.1,153.0 117.0,149.5 120.9,146.1 124.8,142.6 128.7,139.2 132.5,135.7 136.4,132.3 140.3,128.8 144.2,125.4 148.1,121.9 151.9,118.5 155.8,115.0 159.7,111.5 163.6,108.1 167.5,104.6 171.3,101.2 175.2,97.7 179.1,94.3 183.0,90.8 186.9,87.4 190.7,83.9 194.6,80.5 198.5,77.0 202.4,73.5 206.3,70.1 210.1,66.6 214.0,63.2 217.9,59.7 221.8,56.3 225.7,52.8 229.6,49.4 233.4,45.9 233.4,45.9 229.6,56.1 225.7,65.9 221.8,75.4 217.9,84.6 214.0,93.4 210.1,101.9 206.3,110.0 202.4,117.8 198.5,125.2 194.6,132.3 190.7,139.0 186.9,145.4 183.0,151.4 179.1,157.1 175.2,162.5 171.3,167.5 167.5,172.2 163.6,176.5 159.7,180.5 155.8,184.1 151.9,180.8 148.1,177.9 144.2,175.3 140.3,173.0 136.4,171.1 132.5,169.6 128.7,168.4 124.8,167.5 120.9,167.0 117.0,166.8 113.1,167.0 109.3,167.5 105.4,168.4 101.5,169.6 97.6,171.1 93.7,173.0 89.9,175.3 86.0,177.9 82.1,180.8 78.2,184.1' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><p